    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17320" root="زأبق" body-key="z">
    
      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَأْبَقَ</span></b>  <i>He did over</i> dirhems, or pieces of
money, <i>with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِئْبِق</span> [i. e. <i>quicksilver</i>]. (Mgh.) [It
is said that] the verb [from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زئبق</span>, or rather its
inf. n.,] is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّزْبِيقُ</span>: (TA:) [but see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَزَأْبَقٌ</span>, below.]

